  "body": "QUALITY FAMILY HOME FOR RELOCATION\r\nA fantastic opportunity to secure a quality 3 bedroom, 2 bathroom home ready to relocate to your site.\r\nAt approximately 90m², this home offers a practical family-friendly layout with the added bonus of two bathrooms – a sought-after feature in a relocatable home of this size.\r\nProperty Features:\r\n- 3 bedrooms\r\n- 2 bathrooms\r\n- Approx. 90m²\r\n- Practical family layout\r\n- Ready for relocation\r\n\r\n$160,000 incl. GST\r\nPrice includes:\r\nDelivery within 200km of Auckland and placement onto standard pile foundations.\r\nForde Brothers can also assist with the relocation and consent process, with an experienced in-house architectural team and contacts for geotechnical and surveying requirements.\r\nHave land but unsure whether this house will work on your site?\r\nGet in touch with our team and we can discuss access, site requirements and the relocation process with you.\r\nCall Mike – 027 559 9386\r\nMike@fordebrothers.co.nz\r\nMore relocatable homes available – check out our other listings or visit the Forde Brothers website. https://fordebrothers.co.nz/properties/",
